  "bounded_key_contract": "All FFS-marked rows have one Agenda number and one authored event period. 147 have missing sequence; their latest event2018-08-24 is strictly earlier than at least10 complete-key FFS records at2025-11-21. Thus source-unspecified secondary NULL placement cannot change requested top10 identity/order. No generic NULL policy is inferred; no incomplete record is removed.",
